  "readme": "# Warden Gashlift — Split Keel Salvage Stack\n\nPORTRAIT-001 DIFFICULT Creator A. True 1024×2048 material cells and perpendicular side elevation. Original [Warden Scrapline donor #124](https://github.com/techrote/sandmapsreference/pull/124) at immutable `99616a8c8d2475ad4145a8489c0cc8850b1bd783` read-only. No rotation, crop, stretch, or source coordinate transplant. Use `node build.cjs` to reproduce all Setup, receipt, material-only overview, 1:1 gallery and aspect metadata from design.json.\n\n- Distinct upper entered freight wreck/drylock and separate grounded right crane with salvage magnet.\n- Three increasingly deep interrupted cargo trestles, an entered press hall, lower customs plus three-grade export and western service return.\n- Intentional unfinished relay joints, cavern airspace, and repair bays are kept as editable corpus affordances.\n- No native Windows Godot/Bridge/Rapier or save/reopen evidence. NATIVE-UNTESTED; Draft/HOLD. See receipt.json for exact-HEAD source-static tests.\n"
